{'symbol': 'LNC', 'date': '2023-03-15 14:15:00', 'title': "LINCOLN FINANCIAL GROUP NAMED ONE OF THE WORLD'S MOST ETHICAL COMPANIES® BY ETHISPHERE FOR SECOND CONSECUTIVE YEAR", 'text': "RADNOR, PA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--LINCOLN FINANCIAL GROUP (NYSE: LNC) HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED BY ETHISPHERE, A GLOBAL LEADER IN DEFINING AND ADVANCING THE STANDARDS OF ETHICAL BUSINESS PRACTICES, AS ONE OF THE 2023 WORLD'S MOST ETHICAL COMPANIES FOR THE SECOND CONSECUTIVE YEAR. LINCOLN FINANCIAL IS ONE OF ONLY SEVEN HONOREES IN THE FINANCIAL SERVICES INDUSTRY AND 135 HONOREES TOTAL – SPANNING 19 COUNTRIES AND 46 INDUSTRIES."}